  "brain_first": "“先看第二段首句，再决定第一段必须走到哪里。”",
  "sort_order": 1064,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "RECOGNISE - How it usually looks",
      "sourcePage": 97,
      "sourceIndex": 2580
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "给一段原文和两个续写段落首句。",
      "sourcePage": 97,
      "sourceIndex": 2581
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TERM - What the term really means",
      "sourcePage": 97,
      "sourceIndex": 2582
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Given opening sentences are hard constraints，",
      "sourcePage": 97,
      "sourceIndex": 2583
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "限制故事路线。",
      "sourcePage": 97,
      "sourceIndex": 2584
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "THINK - First sentence in your head: “先看第二段首句，再决定第一段必须走到哪里。”",
      "sourcePage": 97,
      "sourceIndex": 2585
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "WHY - Why this works: 很多续写跑题不是英语问题，而是没有先做“桥接”。",
      "sourcePage": 97,
      "sourceIndex": 2586
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STEPS - Follow this route",
      "sourcePage": 97,
      "sourceIndex": 2587
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1 列人物和当前问题。",
      "sourcePage": 97,
      "sourceIndex": 2588
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2 读第一段首句，确定第一段从哪里开始。",
      "sourcePage": 97,
      "sourceIndex": 2589
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3 读第二段首句，确定第一段必须以什么状态结束。",
      "sourcePage": 97,
      "sourceIndex": 2590
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4 在两端之间只安排2-4个必要事件。",
      "sourcePage": 97,
      "sourceIndex": 2591
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "5 第二段解决主问题并收束情绪。",
      "sourcePage": 97,
      "sourceIndex": 2592
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "✏ 草稿纸上具体写什么： 在空旁标词性 V/N/Adj/Adv；故事题用箭头记情绪/动作，如",
      "sourcePage": 97,
      "sourceIndex": 2593
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "worried→help→relieved；难空先打 ? 继续。",
      "sourcePage": 97,
      "sourceIndex": 2594
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "IF/THEN - If... then...",
      "sourcePage": 97,
      "sourceIndex": 2595
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 第二段首句出现“Three days later...” → 第一段不能把三天后的事情提前写完",
      "sourcePage": 97,
      "sourceIndex": 2596
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 第二段首句人物拿着某物 → 第一段必须解释物品如何到手",
      "sourcePage": 97,
      "sourceIndex": 2597
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STOP - Stop when: 第一段最后一句能自然接第二段首句，不需要解释跳跃。",
      "sourcePage": 97,
      "sourceIndex": 2598
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STUCK - If you are stuck: 写不出情节时，不要发明新人物/新事故；先用原文已有的人、物、目标解",
      "sourcePage": 97,
      "sourceIndex": 2599
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "决。",
      "sourcePage": 97,
      "sourceIndex": 2600
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "EXAMPLE - Worked example",
      "sourcePage": 97,
      "sourceIndex": 2601
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "第二段首句是 When she opened the door, everyone began to clap. 第一段就必须把人物带到“到达/开",
      "sourcePage": 97,
      "sourceIndex": 2602
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "门前”的状态，而不能提前写完庆祝。",
      "sourcePage": 97,
      "sourceIndex": 2603
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TRAPS - Common traps",
      "sourcePage": 98,
      "sourceIndex": 2604
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 第一段把问题全部解决，第二段无事可写。",
      "sourcePage": 98,
      "sourceIndex": 2605
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 突然加入原文没有铺垫的大事故。",
      "sourcePage": 98,
      "sourceIndex": 2606
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "CHECK - Final check",
      "sourcePage": 98,
      "sourceIndex": 2607
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 第一段结尾能接第二段吗？",
      "sourcePage": 98,
      "sourceIndex": 2608
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 第二段是否解决原问题？",
      "sourcePage": 98,
      "sourceIndex": 2609
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "🔧 纠错动作： 做完不要只对答案，先给错误归类。错误代码： C-P 词性错｜C-X 搭配错｜C-R 复现没发现",
      "sourcePage": 98,
      "sourceIndex": 2610
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "｜C-E 情绪线错｜C-S 故事情节逻辑错。",
      "sourcePage": 98,
      "sourceIndex": 2611
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "同一种错误连续出现2次 → 在对应代码旁画★，下次做题先检查这一项。",
      "sourcePage": 98,
      "sourceIndex": 2612
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "MEMORY - 30-second memory: 续写先看两段首句，倒推第一段终点。",
      "sourcePage": 98,
      "sourceIndex": 2613
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "可选巩固｜5题（查完SOP后再做）",
      "sourcePage": 98,
      "sourceIndex": 2615
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1. 续写先看什么？",
      "sourcePage": 98,
      "sourceIndex": 2616
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2. 第二段首句已回到家，第一段结尾必须？",
      "sourcePage": 98,
      "sourceIndex": 2617
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3. 能否第一段写到完全无关的新人物？",
      "sourcePage": 98,
      "sourceIndex": 2618
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4. 倒推的目标？",
      "sourcePage": 98,
      "sourceIndex": 2619
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "5. 路线草稿最少含？",
      "sourcePage": 98,
      "sourceIndex": 2620
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "答案速查：1. 两个给定段首句。；2. 产生“回家/在回家途中”的连接。；3. 一般不要，除非原文有伏笔。；4. 让",
      "sourcePage": 98,
      "sourceIndex": 2621
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "P1结尾自然接P2首句。；5. 人物+问题+P1终点+P2解决。",
      "sourcePage": 98,
      "sourceIndex": 2622
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "— CW1 本题型到这里。下次卡住直接 Ctrl+F 搜“CW1”或题型关键词。—",
      "sourcePage": 98,
      "sourceIndex": 2623
    }
  ],
